            "review_text": "Peter N\nCopenhagen, Denmark55 contributions\n0\nFantastic service and great wine\nJul 2016 • Family\nWe were going for the jazz next door. Fell upon restaurant and were welcomed, dined and wined at our outmost pleasure. The manager and waiters were very attentive all night.\n\nAsk if they might sell some of their amazing wine from their fancy tank. We got amazing wine from there, at much less than 1/2 price.\n\nWe were 8 people and had a great experience.\nRead more\nWritten July 26, 2016",
